    {
      "source": "Begin creating an <code>INSERT</code> operation for given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a>创建<code>INSERT</code>操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default,the table to operate on is derived from the initial <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> and can be defined there via\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> annotation. Using <code>inTable</code> allows to override\nthe table name for the execution.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，要操作的表是从初始<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>派生的，并可通过<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a>注解在此定义。使用<code>inTable</code>可以覆盖执行时的表名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
