      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveInsertOperation.ReactiveInsert.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveInsertOperation.ReactiveInsert</code></a> interface provides methods for constructing <code>INSERT</code> operations in a fluent way.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveInsertOperation.ReactiveInsert.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveInsertOperation.ReactiveInsert</code></a> 接口提供了以流畅方式构建 <code>INSERT</code> 操作的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Trigger <code>INSERT</code> execution by calling one of the terminating methods.",
      "translation": "通过调用终止方法之一来触发 `<code>INSERT</code>` 执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Table override (optional).",
      "translation": "表覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"insert(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the application domain object.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"insert(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 应用程序域对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>类型</code></a>。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> is null.",
