      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveInsertOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveInsertOperation</code></a> interface allows creation and execution of <code>INSERT</code> operations in a fluent\nAPI style.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveInsertOperation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveInsertOperation</code></a> 接口允许以流式 API 风格创建并执行 <code>INSERT</code> 操作。",
      "count": 1
